# SPA fallback for Netlify / Cloudflare Pages.
#
# Vite copies public/ into dist/ verbatim, so this ships with the build.
# Without it, deep links such as /student, /verify-email and /reset-password
# return 404 — including the links Kio emails for verification and password
# reset. The nginx equivalent lives in deploy/nginx.conf; the Vercel
# equivalent in vercel.json.
#
# 200 (rewrite), not 301/302: the browser must keep the original URL so React
# Router can read the ?token= query parameter off it.

/*    /index.html   200
